OL,3,GNEWSABiker killed in Isle of Lewis
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died after a crash
OL,7,Fon the Stornoway to Ness road on the
OL,8,FIsle of Lewis.
OL,10,FThe crash involved a silver MG car and
OL,11,Fa black BMW S1000 RS motorcycle on the
OL,12,FA857 near New Park, Newmarket, at about
OL,13,F16:40 on Saturday
OL,15,FEmergency services attended and the
OL,16,F56-year-old male rider was taken to
OL,17,FWestern Isles Hospital where he died.
OL,18,FNobody else was injured.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
